    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"This volume contains the on-site lithologic description, the raw geophysical data, and the initial core box pictures for the Elizabethtown corehole (BL-244/BL-C-1-2003), from Bladen County, North Carolina, USA.  Geologic formation designations are preliminary, and represent the first interpretation made while coring.  Further, more detailed examination of corehole material may result in a change\r\nof lithologic designation.  A complete record of the core-run log and sampling log are supplied herein. Aquifer picks are preliminary and may change upon further examination of core material.  The geophysical data supplied herein is raw and has not been modified from its original format.\"",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
